  "title": "HyperEx Flow Calibration - Low Water",
  "author": "ladiosupp / HyperEx",
  "notes": "EMPTY BASKET ONLY. HyperEx v0.1.37 Low Water Target-LUT calibration. Prime 3.00 ml/s x 3.0 s, then three 3-point target-search blocks in HyperEx order: S1 ~2 g/s, S2 ~5 g/s, S3 ~1.5 g/s after high flow. 9 measured plateaus x 7.5 s; nominal DE1 command water about 95 ml. Use a 300 ml or larger catch vessel. Plugin actively stops around 240 g actual collected water. A new LUT is saved/synced only when all three target blocks pass; invalid runs keep the previous valid LUT.",
